                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Correct. A rechargeable battery operates as an electrolytic cell when it is being recharged with external power."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "a8059ed89df140168d6cc4e51ab16571",
                    "type": "p"
